Today is Sunday.
It is the month of February.
The weather is good in Kochi now.
This morning is very quiet.
I am looking at my calendar.
I am planning this week's tasks.
From Monday to Friday, I go to the office.
Every day at eight o'clock in the morning, I go to the office.
So, I have time only in the evenings.
In the evening, I do my personal tasks.
On Tuesday and Thursday, I go to the gym.
I always go there on time.
I need to get a haircut this week.
At what time should I go for a haircut?
I will decide that tomorrow.
I also need to repair my bicycle.
Sometimes I ride my bicycle in the evening.
I write all these things in the calendar.
The coming week is very busy.
But today I am relaxing at home.
